#. Tag: para
#: man-kmag.1.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kmag</command>, also known as &kmagnifier; is a screen magnifier. You "
"can use &kmagnifier; to magnify a part of the screen just as you would use a "
"lens to magnify a newspaper fine-print or a photograph. This application is "
"useful for a variety of people: from researchers to artists to web-designers to "
"people with low vision."
msgstr ""

